WEBVTT

00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:04,140
Okay, so this is your foot bath tutorial.

00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:07,740
So at this point, you should be familiar with using your rife machine.

00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:14,080
So the pieces with your foot bath are going to be a bucket, a true rife insert here

00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:19,440
which actually will be placed right into your water and then your grounding pillow.

00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:23,500
You will also want to get either sea salt or Himalayan salt.

00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,340
This is what you will be adding into your foot bath.

00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:30,740
So the first step is to fill up this bucket with this submerged into it about halfway

00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:31,740
here.

00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:36,500
Then you will add a tablespoon of your sea salt and you'll just sprinkle that into

00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,000
the water.

00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,180
And then your grounding pillow will be placed right behind your back when you're seated

00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,680
in your chair.

00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:48,860
And you'll want to wear a thin shirt or just your bare back to keep you grounded while

00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:52,900
you're doing this.

00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:58,240
The next piece is you will plug in the two cords, the one, the smaller one, connects

00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,840
to your grounding pillow.

00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:06,440
That goes right into your rife here where it says GRLED, you'll plug that in.

00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:10,400
And then where it says ion is where you'll plug in the big thick one.

00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:13,040
This is the device that goes into your foot bath.

00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:14,040
So you'll plug that in.

00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:17,040
So they both get plugged in here.

00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:23,400
And then you take this little toggle and you flip it to bath.

00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:30,880
Then on your laptop for your true, in your true rife icon, you already have it open.

00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:35,520
You go to your open home to get to all of your programs.

00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:43,600
And then you will have in your folder that says AA your name when you open that it'll say

00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:45,440
ion pro wave down here.

00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:52,640
If you have a specific program, if you do not have a specific program and you just got

00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:58,520
this for purposes of detoxing or other things you might be using this for, you go right

00:01:58,520 --> 00:02:01,880
here into the ion pro wave folder.

00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:05,040
And then you pick whichever program you want.

00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:10,840
So I'm just going to go right here to the detoxification clear line, go to open.

00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:16,800
You see here the image pops up, tells you which program you're in and then you hit run.

00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:21,640
And this will run just like your bulb does.

00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:25,920
The effect light then turns on on your rife machine.

00:02:25,920 --> 00:02:30,500
And then it starts flashing blue when it is on as well.

00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:36,600
If you want to pause this, you run it just like you do with your hammer bulb and you hit pause.

00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:38,960
If you want to stop, you hit stop.

00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:43,840
Typically, these programs are about one hour long.

00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:51,040
When you are finished using your foot bath, make sure that you switch this back to bulb.

00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:54,600
And then you are ready to use your hammer bulb once again.

00:02:54,600 --> 00:03:01,520
And you can unplug your two cords here because you are no longer doing the foot bath.

00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:06,840
And then you will be able to dump out the water.

00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:09,480
The water will then be different color.

00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:14,760
It will be dirty and you can just pour that right out, rinse out the bucket.

00:03:14,760 --> 00:03:20,000
You can take this device, rinse it under the water, get everything cleaned up.

00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:24,680
I do recommend before you take your feet out, you have a clean pitcher of water next to

00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:29,680
you and you rinse them off over the bucket and then dry them off before you just get out

00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,680
of there.

00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,800
Just give us a call if you have any other questions.

00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,320
Thank you.

